  "privacyTitle": "Before you start: your privacy",
  "privacyBody": "This app runs on your personal phone.\n\n• It uses the camera only inside the app: to scan QR codes on street lights and to take work photos. Photos are not saved to your gallery, and the app does not access your gallery, files, contacts or other apps. Work photos are deleted from the phone once uploaded.\n• It does not track your location. (In later versions the location is recorded only at the moment you capture work evidence, with the app open.)\n• Its data is encrypted inside the app's private storage and protected by a PIN.\n• The municipality cannot wipe or manage your phone. If your device is revoked, the server rejects it and the app deletes only its own data.\n• The work you record is kept in a verifiable audit log.",
